---
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import naswaPhoto from '../assets/naswa.jpg';
---
<section id="about" class="relative mx-auto max-w-content overflow-x-clip px-6 py-24">
  <p class="watermark pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-10 select-none text-center font-display text-[14vw] leading-none text-surface" data-text="ABOUT" aria-hidden="true"></p>
  <div class="relative">
  <SectionHeading number="01" title="About" />
  <div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_280px] sm:items-start">
    <div class="space-y-5 text-lg text-ink-2">
      <p>Hi, I'm Naswa, some people call me Endabelyu (it's how you say the letter "W" in Indonesian). I'm a fullstack developer with 3 years of professional experience. My deepest production work is on the frontend: complex interfaces for enterprise clients in insurance and system integration, where I care as much about maintainable code as about a product that genuinely helps the people using it.</p>
      <p>But I don't stop at the interface. I design and ship complete products on my own: backend APIs, databases, auth, and deployment. Several of them are live and in real use. I've built more optical retail systems than most developers will encounter in a career, from lens prescription tracking to multi-branch POS and inventory, and I'm applying the same solo-shipping approach to personal finance and business automation. You can see all of them in the <a href="#projects" class="text-accent underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Projects section below</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="order-first aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-[280px] overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-border bg-surface sm:order-none">
      <Image src={naswaPhoto} alt="Naswa Wilantama, fullstack developer" widths={[280, 560]} sizes="280px" loading="lazy" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
